<title>JAPAN: Fuji Photo won't comment on Kodak tie-up report.</title>
<headline>Fuji Photo won't comment on Kodak tie-up report.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuji Photo Film Co Ltd declined to comment on Monday on a weekend newspaper report that it had agreed with Eastman Kodak Co to tie up in the digital camera business.</p>
<p>&quot;We have nothing to tell you on the subject now,&quot; a Fuji Photo spokesman said.</p>
<p>The Japanese business daily Nihon Keizai Shimbun said the tie-up would include standardisation of memory cards for digital cameras between Fuji and Kodak.</p>
</text>
